WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.210
Far to the southwest, in Cilicia,

2
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.365
Armenians built a new kingdom.

3
00:00:07.405 --> 00:00:11.990
King Hethum I bound it
to the rising power of the Mongols.

4
00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:17.060
But in 1260 the Mamluks of Egypt
defeated the Mongols,

5
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:22.636
and soon their new sultan, Baybars,
turned against the Mongols' allies.

6
00:00:22.996 --> 00:00:27.766
In 1266, while Hethum
hurried to the Mongols for help,

7
00:00:27.806 --> 00:00:30.971
his sons Leo and Thoros
led the defense.

8
00:00:31.011 --> 00:00:33.925
Baybars sent
a Mamluk army against them.

9
00:00:33.965 --> 00:00:37.425
By one account,
it went around the guarded pass.

10
00:00:37.785 --> 00:00:42.075
In the battle remembered as Mari,
the chronicler Vahram writes,

11
00:00:42.115 --> 00:00:44.188
the princes stood their ground.

12
00:00:44.228 --> 00:00:47.934
Thoros was killed,
and Leo was taken prisoner.

13
00:00:47.974 --> 00:00:52.077
The invaders burned Sis,
yet, he says, the forts held.

14
00:00:52.437 --> 00:00:54.727
In 1268 Leo came home,

15
00:00:54.767 --> 00:00:57.343
and the next year he became king.

16
00:00:57.703 --> 00:01:00.474
Hold the way into Cilicia.

